<title>USA: Portage, Ind., won by NatCity.</title>
<headline>Portage, Ind., won by NatCity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatCity Investments said it won $2.780 million of Portage Dept of Storm Water Mgt., Ind., storm water mgt district bonds of 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.86 percent.</p>
